---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const services=[['01','System design','Align products and control requirements with the project brief.','/Nubelon/images/generated/nubelon-system-design.png'],['02','Installation','Coordinate installation scope and technical requirements.','/Nubelon/images/generated/nubelon-installation.png'],['03','Commissioning','Support testing, startup and handover planning.','/Nubelon/images/generated/nubelon-commissioning.png']];
---
<BaseLayout><header class="nav"><div class="wrap nav-inner"><a class="logo" href="/Nubelon/">NUBE<span>LON</span></a><nav class="nav-links"><a href="/Nubelon/products/">Products</a><a href="/Nubelon/services/">Services</a><a href="/Nubelon/brands/">Brands</a><a class="btn" href="/Nubelon/contact/">Request a Quote</a></nav></div></header><main><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Industrial automation · Middle East</div><h1>Control the next<br/>move.</h1><p>Industrial electrical control products, instrumentation and project support for manufacturers, integrators and engineering teams.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/Nubelon/contact/">Discuss your project ↗</a><a class="btn alt" href="/Nubelon/products/">Explore products</a></div></div><img class="hero-image" src="/Nubelon/images/generated/nubelon-hero-control-room.png" alt="AI concept image of an industrial control room" /></section><section id="products"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Product supply</div><h2>Find the right<br/>control layer.</h2></div><p>From industrial control components to measurement and analytics instruments, tell us what your project needs.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><img class="card-image" src="/Nubelon/images/generated/nubelon-plc-hmi.png" alt="AI concept image of generic PLC and HMI equipment" /><span class="num">01 / CONTROL</span><h3>Industrial control</h3><p>Control components, PLCs, HMIs, drives, motion and industrial networking.</p><a href="/Nubelon/products/industrial-control/">Explore category →</a></article><article class="card"><img class="card-image" src="/Nubelon/images/generated/nubelon-control-products.png" alt="AI concept image of generic industrial electrical control products" /><span class="num">02 / POWER</span><h3>Switchgear & protection</h3><p>Electrical control, switching, protection and power distribution components.</p><a href="/Nubelon/products/switchgear-protection/">Explore category →</a></article><article class="card"><img class="card-image" src="/Nubelon/images/generated/nubelon-middle-east-industry.png" alt="AI concept image of a modern industrial instrumentation facility" /><span class="num">03 / MEASUREMENT</span><h3>Instrumentation</h3><p>Measurement and analytics equipment for industrial and process applications.</p><a href="/Nubelon/products/instrumentation/">Explore category →</a></article></div></div></section><section id="services" class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Project support</div><h2>From specification<br/>to commissioning.</h2></div><p>A clear engineering path for projects that need more than a product list.</p></div><div class="cards">{services.map(([num,title,desc,img])=><article class="card"><img class="card-image" src={img} alt={`AI concept image for ${title}`} /><span class="num">{num}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><section id="brands"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Brands in our portfolio</div><h2 class="display-title">A focused industrial<br/>technology network.</h2><div class="brands">{['ABB','Siemens','Schneider Electric','Rockwell Automation','Eaton','Hitachi Energy','Emerson','Endress+Hauser','Phoenix Contact','Weidmüller','Arteche'].map((brand)=><span class="brand">{brand}</span>)}</div></div></section><section id="contact" class="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#fff">Start a conversation</div><h2 class="contact-title">Have a part number, BOM or project brief?</h2><p>Send your requirements and our sales team will follow up with the right next step.</p><a class="btn" href="mailto:nubelon@163.com">Request a quote ↗</a></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap footer-row"><span>Nubelon Technology (Xiamen) Co., Ltd.</span><span>Industrial automation · Xiamen, China</span><span>nubelon@163.com · +86 13051108770</span></div></footer></BaseLayout><style>.nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%}.display-title{font:600 clamp(32px,4vw,52px)/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:16px 0 36px}.contact-title{font:600 clamp(38px,5vw,68px)/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.06em;max-width:700px;margin:18px 0}</style>
